      "message": "fix(sim): credit bounded 3D edge-break volumes\n\nKeep legacy cone records and add framed flat, ball and rounded caps.\nCredit only connected declared material and retain operation width bounds.\nPreserve framed records through project files and tilted work frames.\n\nCo-Authored-By: OpenAI Codex <noreply@openai.com>\n\nFixes #1891",
